# Build output
/build/
/bin/
*.obj
*.exe
*.a
*.dll

# Screenshot test output -- regenerated by tools/smoketest.ps1
/testshots/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything below is *generated from other people's games* by the tools in
# tools/, and is deliberately not redistributed here.
#
#   assets/      built by tools/stage_assets.py (Grand Theft Jack 3D + Naval
#                Command), tools/import_kingdom_trees.py (Kingdom), and
#                tools/extract_glb_textures.py. assets/maps is the exception
#                -- those are ours, generated by tools/make_maps.py, and are
#                tracked below.
#   extracted/   the raw GMK 8.0 dump produced by tools/gmk_extract.py
#   drive-download-*/  the GTJ3D audio download
#   vendor/      the raylib binary distribution
#
# To get a playable tree from a fresh clone, see the Assets section of
# README.md: point the tools at your own copies and they rebuild all of it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/assets/*
!/assets/maps/
/extracted/
/drive-download-*/
/vendor/
*.gmk
